# ⚡ MCU Tracker

A modern Marvel Cinematic Universe tracker with Firebase sync, admin panel, TMDB integration, and 6 complete themes.

## 🌐 Live Site

Deploy on GitHub Pages (Settings → Pages → Branch: main → Save)

## ✨ Features

- 🎬 **Dynamic Movies** — No hardcoded data. All movies added via admin panel
- 🔐 **Firebase Auth** — Email/Password + Google Sign-In
- ☁️ **Cloud Sync** — Watched + Favorites sync across devices
- 🛡️ **Master Admin Panel** — Add, edit, delete movies with TMDB auto-fill
- 🎨 **6 Complete Themes** — Midnight, Stark, Wakanda, Gamma, Cosmic, Infinity
- ⏱️ **Countdown Timers** — Set custom countdowns for upcoming releases
- 📱 **Fully Responsive** — Works on mobile, tablet, desktop
- ⚡ **Smooth Animations** — Card reveals, hover effects, transitions
- 🎯 **Search/Filter/Sort** — Find movies instantly

